# Floxis

> Server-side ad infrastructure for publisher-controlled monetization. Managed OpenRTB, Prebid.js, and Prebid Server infrastructure that publishers operate on their own terms — no lock-in, no opaque routing.

Floxis sits between a publisher's existing demand relationships and their ad serving stack. It handles the operational complexity of running production server-side ad infrastructure (oRTB routing, Prebid.js wrappers, Prebid Server adapters) without taking ownership of those demand relationships or the publisher's economic decisions.

The platform is built for publishers, SSPs, and ad ops teams that want the technical capability of an in-house ad-tech stack without the engineering build-out or the vendor entanglement that traditional ad-tech infrastructure carries.

What sets Floxis apart in the publisher-monetization category:

- **Publisher-controlled**: the publisher keeps direct demand contracts; Floxis is infrastructure, not a reseller.
- **Low-latency server-side**: managed exchange-grade RTB infrastructure, with a 200-300ms DSP bid timeout, without operating a self-hosted Kubernetes cluster.
- **Wrapper-agnostic**: integrates with Prebid.js, Prebid Server, or direct oRTB — publishers pick the integration layer.

## Products

- [OpenRTB Infrastructure](https://floxis.tech/product-rtb): Server-side OpenRTB infrastructure. Route, price, and manage programmatic demand while preserving existing ad servers and demand relationships.
- [Prebid.js Infrastructure](https://floxis.tech/product-prebidjs): Publisher-owned Prebid.js infrastructure. Full control over bidder configuration, timeouts, and yield on managed server-side infrastructure.
- [Prebid Server Infrastructure](https://floxis.tech/product-prebid-server): Managed Prebid Server with publisher control over adapters, routing, and bidder relationships. Server-side auctions at scale.
- [Products overview](https://floxis.tech/products): The three layers of server-side infrastructure, designed to work together or independently.
- [RTB for Publishers](https://floxis.tech/for-publishers): Server-side ad infrastructure for publishers. Connect your demand over OpenRTB, Prebid.js or Prebid Server — and keep every relationship.

